  message: "Reopened: tranch_03 card 046 (anon-card-tranch03-046, sourced from F48.A1+F48.A3 cluster-002, filed as WI-golov) reports spec §14 docs still describe tier 2 as 'Internal libraries, monorepo packages' and list test paths under tier 2, while INV-tisid's code refactor routed tests to tier 1. Code+docs out of sync; INV-tisid satisfied is misleading because consumer-facing contract (the spec doc) still asserts the pre-fix behavior. Substrate HEAD 9a18959071. Blind severity 4 (Significant). Reopened per playbook Phase 6.1 Step 4a status-adjustment rule (default-to-reopen branch)."  # 9e3b
