  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0041, merged in PR #4181): tier 2 is narrowed to workspace-internal only, directness splits out into a registered meta key (direct|transitive|undeclared), and spec section 14 is rewritten. The workspace-package test-dir routing gets re-derived under that narrowed tier-2 definition. Stays violated until the classifier fix lands; re-validate then."  # 9364
