  clock: 13  # 7fd7
  nonce: 7fd7  # 7fd7
  message: "[Wave-0 hygiene re-verify] INV-tisid code fix is complete and verified. Both workspace and non-workspace test-directory branches now correctly return Tier.FIRST_PARTY with is_test=True. Regression tests (Cargo workspace + drown-out comparator) pass.\n\nHowever, spec documentation residue remains (held by WI-golov): hypergumbo-spec.md:1293 still names tier 2 as \"Internal libraries, monorepo packages\" without clarifying that tests are tier 1; spec:1401 lists test directory patterns but doesn't note they route to tier 1 post-fix. Per tracker discussion 2026-06-11T04:25:53Z, spec §14 rewrite is ordered as part of ADR-0041 (merged PR #4181) which narrowed tier 2 to \"workspace-internal only\" with new directness meta-axis. Recommend downgrading to WI-golov (doc-only tracker item, status todo_hard) — the invariant-violation in code is resolved; documentation drift is a separate concern tracked separately."  # 7fd7
